      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 106.24,
      "speaker": "SPEAKER_00",
      "text": "In Ras Al Khaimah. And there was a funny story. There were several people going with us. And on the way there, I think we had a stop in one of the gas stations. And his child, he accidentally spilled the coffee on the car. On the car remote system. And the car wasn't working at all. Eventually, we went to the camping. And he put his family with someone in another car. And when it was time to leave, we asked our friends to take his family with them. And take him back home. But since his car was stuck in Ras Al Khaimah, we decided to stay in the mountains together. So, it was a funny situation. That we were just, you know, we barely know each other. But he's definitely fond of the nature and stuff. So, we spent the whole... night talking about investment, lifestyle in Dubai. And then in the morning, we went to recover his car. And it was another funny story of how we worked out this whole procedure with three Pakistani guys that were trying to take money from us.",
